
Setting up virtual environment and setting up the server

amithwrk@amithwrk-VirtualBox:~/Downloads/api development$ python3.12 -m venv venv
amithwrk@amithwrk-VirtualBox:~/Downloads/api development$ source venv/bin/activate
(venv) amithwrk@amithwrk-VirtualBox:~/Downloads/api development$ pip install fastapi uvicorn


Running the fastapi server

uvicorn main_1:app --reload
